# The other direction of the one group: Bot2 controls Liliana of the Veil (mana value 3) and Sheoldred, the Apocalypse
# (mana value 4). In Bot2's end step on turn 4 Bot1 casts Break Under Pressure; the creature is sacrificed, the planeswalker
# stays, and Bot1 gains 2 life (Sheoldred gone, Bot1 loses nothing more).

